@SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress = http://localhost:5006

GET {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Check-in
POST {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/checkin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId" :1
}

### Check-out
POST {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1
}

### Zmiana godziny wejścia
PUT {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newCheckInTime": "2026-08-01T08:00:00"
}

### Historia obecności
GET {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/1

### Urlop
POST {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/leaves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "dateFrom": "2026-11-01T00:00:00",
  "dateTo": "2026-11-08T00:00:00",
  "reason": "Choroba"
}

### Pobranie urlopów
GET {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/leaves?employeeId=1

### Akceptacja urlopu
PUT {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/leaves/3/approve

###Odrzucenie urlopu
PUT {{SystemUserAttendance_HostAddress}}/api/leaves/3/reject
